        style 69 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        70["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Uncertainty Estimator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: SciPy]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Wilson intervals for<br />proportions, stratified<br />bootstrap for weighted<br />accuracy and AUC; always<br />reports n.</div>"]
        style 70 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        71["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Level Gate Evaluator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Python]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Compares coverage and<br />accuracy, with intervals,<br />against the configured Level<br />1/2/3 targets and reports<br />pass or fail, with the<br />interval beside it.</div>"]
        style 71 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        72["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Loop Health Meter</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Python]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Triage latency, share<br />adjudicated, time to update,<br />review backlog, expired<br />changes.</div>"]
        style 72 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        73["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Guardrail Ablation Evaluator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Python]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Runs paired experiments with<br />guardrails on vs off (and one<br />guard off at a time) on<br />synthetic clean and<br />adversarial sets; reports<br />invented-amount,<br />edited-amount,<br />unverifiable-evidence,<br />injection-success, PII-egress<br />and prohibited-action rates<br />next to accuracy, coverage<br />and cost.</div>"]
