      23["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Run Console</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Container: Python 3.12, Typer CLI]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Command-line entry point and<br />the only pipeline<br />orchestrator: 'itemizer run<br /><export.xlsx>'. Resolves<br />configuration, opens a run<br />manifest, runs the stages,<br />and exposes evaluate / review<br />/ promote sub-commands. The<br />Web UI launches runs through<br />it.</div>"]
